Answer: The pattern contains three entities: Number of rows Number of dollar signs in each row Number of stars in each row Therefore, the structure contains: One outer loop for the rows One inner loop for five dollar signs One inner loop for five stars The basic code is:

```java
for (int j = 1; j <= 3; j++) {
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
System.out.print("$");
}
for (int i = 1; i <= 5; i++) {
System.out.print("*");
}
System.out.println();
}
```

Output: $$$$$***** $$$$$***** $$$$$***** The two inner loops execute one after another within each row.
